Curated video
    Twenty seven clips across the twelve chapters are curated through
    `npm run videos` and listed in content/videos.json. Every clip stays
    embedded through the standard YouTube player, remains the property of
    its creator, is served from its own channel, and counts toward that
    channel's views.
    Every channel and the specific clips used are credited on the in-app
    Sources page.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Generated imagery
    None is used in this course. Every figure is authored by hand in
    src/data/diagrams.js, because an image model will invent components and
    mislabel a tree, and a confidently wrong diagram in a teaching product
    is worse than no diagram.
